<div class="home">
  <h2>Home</h2>
  <p>
    Hover the <b>Items</b> link above, then click it. Because hovering fired
    <code>Api.items.prefetch()</code>, the Items page renders instantly — no loading
    flash — even though the query is artificially slow (800&nbsp;ms) on the server.
  </p>
  <p>Navigate straight to <code>/items</code> (or without hovering) and you will see the loading state instead.</p>
</div>

<style>
  .home h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .home p {
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #444;
  }

  code {
    background: #f4f4f8;
    padding: 0.1em 0.35em;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
</style>
